# $service

| What | Command |
|---|---|
| Run locally (reload) | `uv run dx run $service` |
| Add a feature module | `uv run dx new-module $service <plural_name>` |
| Tests | `uv run dx test --service $service` |
| Lint + structure | `uv run dx lint --service $service` |
| Permission matrix | `uv run dx permissions $service` |
| New migration | `uv run dx db revision $service -m "add x"` |
| Dev token | `uv run dx token $service --all` |

Port: **$port**. Docs: http://localhost:$port/docs
